  ✓ 40 cycles · 32 instructions · CPI 1.25 · 0 stalls · 2 mispredictions
    Ends with x5 = 0 · x6 = 55
    Why it slowed down:
    • The branch was wrong (bne was guessed taken, but it fell through), so
      two instructions were thrown away.

